els-ryutaro-tsukata-6249515-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":1149,\"height\":1707,\"width\":2560,\"alt\":\"Picture of bridge surrounded by leaves during the fall\"},\"alignment\":{\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"objectFit\":{\"desktop\":\"cover\"},\"border\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":10,\"right\":10,\"bottom\":10,\"left\":10,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true}}},\"width\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":1783,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":100},\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":100}},\"maxWidth\":{\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":565,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":50}}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-6da855b5\"><img class=\"wp-image-1149\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-ryutaro-tsukata-6249515-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Picture of bridge surrounded by leaves during the fall\" height=\"1707\" width=\"2560\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/paragraph {\"clientId\":\"2b2c05cd\",\"text\":\"Escape from the bustle and stress of everyday life, and relax in the comfort and tranquility of Tozai Hotel\'s guest rooms and gardens. Our expert chefs are ready to delight your taste buds with sashimi and sushi, made only from the choicest cuts of fish delivered daily from Tsukiji market in Tokyo.\",\"alignment\":{\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":400,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color\":\"#303030\",\"margin\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":20,\"bottom\":20}}} -->\n<p class=\"blockart-paragraph blockart-paragraph-2b2c05cd\">Escape from the bustle and stress of everyday life, and relax in the comfort and tranquility of Tozai Hotel\'s guest rooms and gardens. Our expert chefs are ready to delight your taste buds with sashimi a