0,\"bottom\":20,\"left\":0},\"tablet\":{\"top\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-7c59620e\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"a67ad813\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-taryn-elliott-4198566-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":1257,\"height\":2560,\"width\":1707,\"alt\":\"\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-a67ad813\"><img class=\"wp-image-1257 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-taryn-elliott-4198566-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"2560\" width=\"1707\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"c1fb9029\",\"text\":\"Natural Japanese Gardens within a confined space\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"left\"},\"size\":\"small\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-c1fb9029 is-small\">Natural Japanese Gardens within a confined space</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One hallmark of Japanese gardens is the intentional representation of natural scenes within a confined space. This encapsulates the essence of the Japanese belief in capturing the spirit of nature rather than replicating it. The Japanese gardens often incorporate symbolic elements, such as bridges and lanterns, with each feature serving a specific purpose. For example, bridges may symbolize the journey from the mundane to the sacred, while lanterns illuminate paths both physically and metaphorically. Visitors to Japanese gardens are invited to engage with the landscape on a sensory and spiritual level, fostering a connection with nature that transcends the boundaries of the physical garden itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"01c14d67\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/low-angle-view-of-pink-flowers-against-blue-sky-250591-768x1024.jpg\",\"id\":1264,\"height\":1024,\"width\":768,\"alt\":\"Low Angle View of Pink Flowers Against Blue Sky\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-01c14d67\"><img class=\"wp-image-1264 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/low-angle-view-of-pink-flowers-against-blue-sky-250591-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Low Angle View of Pink Flowers Against Blue Sky\" height=\"1024\" width=\"768\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->', 'Gardens', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'japanese-gardens', '', '', '2024-05-14 15:28:18', '2024-05-14 20:28:18', '', 0, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/?page_id=1246', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(1247, 1, '2024-04-30 15:57:08', '2024-04-30 20:57:08', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"817853d4\",\"columns\":2} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-817853d4\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"61415c5d\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":66,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-61415c5d\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese gardens are exquisite landscapes that transcend mere horticulture, embodying a profound connection between nature, spirituality, and aesthetic harmony. Rooted in centuries-old traditions, these meticulously designed spaces are a reflection of the Japanese philosophy of finding beauty in simplicity and<br>balance. Elements such as carefully raked gravel, serene ponds, meticulously pruned trees, and strategically placed rocks create a harmonious composition that invites contemplation and a sense of tranquility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"3723d98a\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":34,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-3723d98a\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->', 'Gardens', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1246-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-04-30 15:57:08', '2024-04-30 20:57:08', '', 1246, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/?p=1247', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
