18b\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/woman-eating-sushi-in-a-restaurant-15433927-683x1024.jpg\",\"id\":1276,\"height\":1024,\"width\":683,\"alt\":\"Woman Eating Sushi in a Restaurant\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-ee01718b\"><img class=\"wp-image-1276 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/woman-eating-sushi-in-a-restaurant-15433927-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman Eating Sushi in a Restaurant\" height=\"1024\" width=\"683\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"6b6583ac\",\"text\":\"Saké—the Perfect Accompaniment\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"left\"},\"size\":\"small\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-6b6583ac is-small\">Saké—the Perfect Accompaniment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese rice wine, saké, makes the perfect accompaniment to your meal. Although saké can be drunk hot, connoisseurs prefer to drink it cold or on the rocks. Drinking saké cold allows you to appreciate the subtle differences in taste that come from the rice variety and water used in the fermentation process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->', 'Dining', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1273-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-03 23:26:09', '2024-05-04 04:26:09', '', 1273, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/?p=1294', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
