sine is not only a feast for the taste buds, but for the eyes. Presentation is an important part of a chef\'s skills. If you enjoy fish, you\'ll love the restaurant at Tozai Hotel, where our master chefs will select the choicest cuts of the day\'s fresh catch to serve you mouth-watering&nbsp;<em>sashimi</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>sushi</em>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"10258117\",\"columns\":2,\"childRow\":true,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"left\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"right\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":20},\"mobile\":{\"right\":10,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":10},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-10258117\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"e91328b2\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-e91328b2\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"72c70c99\",\"text\":\"Blend of artistry and tradition\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-72c70c99\">Blend of artistry and tradition</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese cuisine is a harmonious blend of artistry, tradition, and a profound respect for nature\'s bounty. At its core, it reflects the Japanese philosophy of incorporating seasonal, fresh ingredients into dishes that are not only visually appealing but also deliver a nuanced explosion of flavors. Sushi, perhaps the most internationally renowned facet of Japanese cuisine, showcases the meticulous craftsmanship involved in combining vinegared rice with a variety of ingredients, such as fresh seafood and vegetables, resulting in a culinary masterpiece that delights the senses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"e27ae2f9\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-e27ae2f9 is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"8dc8ab39\",\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"custom\",\"padding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"right\":36,\"bottom\":16,\"left\":36,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":500,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color1\":\"#000000\",\"color2\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor1\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor2\":\"#000000\",\"background1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"hoverBackground1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#0b70f4\"},\"hoverBackground2\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"type\":\"solid\",\"color\":\"#000000\"},\"hoverBorder1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"type\":\"solid\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"border2\":{\"border\":1,\"color\":\"#ffffff\",\"type\":\"solid\",\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true}}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-button blockart-button-8dc8ab39 \"><a class=\"blockart-button-link is-custom is-style-filled\">Read More</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/button-inner --></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"ff500863\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/neon-in-a-japanese-restaurant-18176489-1024x683.jpg\",\"id\":1277,\"height\":683,\"width\":1024,\"alt\":\"Neon in a Japanese Restaurant\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-ff500863\"><img class=\"wp-image-1277 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/neon-in-a-japanese-restaurant-18176489-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Neon in a Japanese Restaurant\" height=\"683\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"1d177802\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"mobile\":{\"top\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":20,\"left\":0},\"tablet\":{\"top\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-1d177802\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"958743d7\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/woman-eating-sushi-in-a-restaurant-15433927-683x1024.jpg\",\"id\":1276,\"height\":1024,\"width\":683,\"alt\":\"Woman Eating Sushi in a Restaurant\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-958743d7\"><img class=\"wp-image-1276 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/woman-eating-sushi-in-a-restaurant-15433927-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman Eating Sushi in a Restaurant\" height=\"1024\" width=\"683\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"6e15dfa0\",\"text\":\"Saké—the Perfect Accompaniment\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"left\"},\"size\":\"small\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-6e15dfa0 is-small\">Saké—the Perfect Accompaniment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese rice wine, saké, makes the perfect accompaniment to your meal. Although saké can be drunk hot, connoisseurs prefer to drink it cold or on the rocks. Drinking saké cold allows you to appreciate the subtle differences in taste that come from the rice variety and water used in the fermentation process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->', 'Dining', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1273-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-03 23:29:19', '2024-05-04 04:29:19', '', 1273, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/?p=1296', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1298, 1, '2024-05-04 23:12:58', '2024-05-05 04:12:58', '<!-- wp:yoast-seo/breadcrumbs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"dd237905\",\"columns\":1,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"bottom\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50,\"right\":10,\"left\":10},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-dd237905\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"ba0f48b4\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100},\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0},\"desktop\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-ba0f48b4\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"a1e4383a\",\"markup\":\"h1\",\"text\":\"Guest Rooms\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"center\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":700,\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":39,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-a1e4383a\">Guest Rooms</h1>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"3670d786\",\"columns\":1,\"childRow\":true} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-3670d786\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"867b4b22\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-867b4b22\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Indulge in the epitome of luxury and tranquility with our exquisite hotel rooms featuring breathtaking views that redefine the art of hospitality. Nestled in the heart of our city, our carefully curated selection of rooms provides an immersive experience that transcends the ordinary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"58d90e3c\",\"columns\":2,\"childRow\":true,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"left\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"right\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":20},\"mobile\":{\"right\":10,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":10},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-58d90e3c\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"6684ad04\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-6684ad04\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"a5ba2779\",\"text\":\"Luxury Amenities\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-a5ba2779\">Luxury Amenities</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unwind in our state-of-the-art fitness center, offering a range of equipment for those seeking an invigorating workout. Culinary enthusiasts will delight in our diverse dining options, each venue a culinary masterpiece that caters to the most discerning palates. Whether you crave a leisurely swim in our expansive pool, desire a moment of serenity in our lush gardens, or simply wish to stay connected with our high-speed Wi-Fi, our amenities are designed to fulfill every desire. At our hotel, every detail, from the sumptuous bedding to the cutting-edge technology, has been thoughtfully curated to ensure a seamless blend of opulence and practicality. Experience a world where every amenity is a testament to our commitment to providing an exceptional and unforgettable stay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"e5e2f7a2\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-e5e2f7a2 is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"b413f54d\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"google.com\",\"newTab\":true},\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"custom\",\"padding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"right\":36,\"bottom\":16,\"left\":36,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":500,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color1\":\"#000000\",\"color2\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor1\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor2\":\"#000000\",\"background1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"hoverBackground1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#0b70f4\"},\"hoverBackground2\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,