(1358, 1, '2024-05-05 10:03:02', '2024-05-05 15:03:02', '<!-- wp:yoast-seo/breadcrumbs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"4ece5211\",\"columns\":1,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"bottom\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50,\"right\":10,\"left\":10},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-4ece5211\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"43b73048\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100},\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0},\"desktop\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-43b73048\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"15df2b98\",\"markup\":\"h1\",\"text\":\"Japanese Gardens\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"center\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":700,\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":39,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-15df2b98\">Japanese Gardens</h1>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"ebaae123\",\"columns\":2,\"childRow\":true,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"left\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"right\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":20},\"mobile\":{\"right\":10,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":10},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-ebaae123\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"71d50360\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-71d50360\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese gardens are exquisite landscapes that transcend mere horticulture, embodying a profound connection between nature, spirituality, and aesthetic harmony. Rooted in centuries-old traditions, these meticulously designed spaces are a reflection of the Japanese philosophy of finding beauty in simplicity and balance. Elements such as carefully raked gravel, serene ponds, meticulously pruned trees, and strategically placed rocks create a harmonious composition that invites contemplation and a sense of tranquility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"d8d48e94\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-d8d48e94 is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"4b5554f7\",\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"custom\",\"padding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"right\":36,\"bottom\":16,\"left\":36,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":500,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color1\":\"#000000\",\"color2\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor1\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor2\":\"#000000\",\"background1\":{\"