",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-taryn-elliott-4198566-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":1257,\"height\":2560,\"width\":1707,\"alt\":\"\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-7982a148\"><img class=\"wp-image-1257 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-taryn-elliott-4198566-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"2560\" width=\"1707\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"6b1f7ff1\",\"text\":\"Natural scenes within a confined space\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"left\"},\"size\":\"small\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-6b1f7ff1 is-small\">Natural scenes within a confined space</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One hallmark of Japanese gardens is the intentional representation of natural scenes within a confined space. This encapsulates the essence of the Japanese belief in capturing the spirit of nature rather than replicating it. The gardens often incorporate symbolic elements, such as bridges and lanterns, with each feature serving a specific purpose. For example, bridges may symbolize the journey from the mundane to the sacred, while lanterns illuminate paths both physically and metaphorically. Visitors to Japanese gardens are invited to engage with the landscape on a sensory and spiritual level, fostering a connection with nature that transcends the boundaries of the physical garden itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"9749f276\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/low-angle-view-of-pink-flowers-against-blue-sky-250591-768x1024.jpg\",\"id\":1264,\"height\":1024,\"width\":768,\"alt\":\"Low Angle View of Pink Flowers Against Blue Sky\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-9749f276\"><img class=\"wp-image-1264 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/low-angle-view-of-pink-flowers-against-blue-sky-250591-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Low Angle View of Pink Flowers Against Blue Sky\" height=\"1024\" width=\"768\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->', 'Blog', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1376-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-05 10:30:30', '2024-05-05 15:30:30', '', 1376, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/?p=1378', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
