leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor’s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"9d33e1d5\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":45,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-9d33e1d5\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"0\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0\"><strong>Media</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\"> </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"39bd7a77\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":45,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-39bd7a77\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"0\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0\"><strong>Cookies</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select \"Remember Me\", your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"e43bb6c9\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":45,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-e43bb6c9\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"0\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0\"><strong>Embedded content from other websites</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"95bb3c12\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":45,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-95bb3c12\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"0\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0\"><strong>Who we share your data with</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"4b52c4fe\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":45,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-4b52c4fe\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"0\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0\"><strong>How long we retain your data</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"1a2de624\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":45,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-1a2de624\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"0\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0\"><strong>What rights you have over your data</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"07b1cd29\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":45,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-07b1cd29\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"0\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0\"><strong>Where your data is sent</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"84a8469a\",\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":35,\"unit\":\"px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-84a8469a\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1444-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-07 16:08:34', '2024-05-07 21:08:34', '', 1444, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/?p=1461', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `iwp_tozai__posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(1463, 1, '2024-05-14 14:51:25', '2024-05-14 19:51:25', '<!-- wp:nextend/smartslider3 {\"slider\":\"6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-nextend-smartslider3\">[smartslider3 slider=\"6\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:nextend/smartslider3 -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"5cb91ff8\",\"columns\":2,\"blockMargin\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":136},\"mobile\":{\"top\":68,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"tablet\":{\"top\":68,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false}},\"blockPadding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"left\":15,\"right\":15,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"right\":15,\"left\":15},\"tablet\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"right\":15,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":15}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-5cb91ff8\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"6e5aeab2\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":50,\"tablet\":50,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-6e5aeab2\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"7b0a4f5a\",\"text\":\"Experience the Life of Beautiful Santorini\",\"color\":\"#303030\",\"alignment\":{\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":600,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":32,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":26,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-7b0a4f5a\">Experience the Life of Beautiful Santorini</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/paragraph {\"clientId\":\"4c7d9d12\",\"text\":\"Tozai is Japanese for \\u0022East-West.\\u0022 It epitomizes the welcome we offer our guests, combining western-style luxury with the best in Japanese cuisine and hospitality.\",\"alignment\":{\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":400,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color\":\"#303030\",\"margin\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"bottom\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"bottom\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"top\":15}}} -->\n<p class=\"blockart-paragraph blockart-paragraph-4c7d9d12\">Tozai is Japanese for \"East-West.\" It epitomizes the welcome we offer our guests, combining western-style luxury with the best in Japanese cuisine and hospitality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"ea661c8d\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-aden-ardenrich-181745-581299-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":1225,\"height\":2560,\"width\":1705,\"alt\":\"\"},\"alignment\":{\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"border\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":10,\"right\":10,\"bottom\":10,\"left\":10,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true}}},\"width\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":1920,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":100},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":100}},\"maxWidth\":{\"tablet\":{\"value\":1920,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":565,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":50}},\"blockMargin\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"tablet\":{\"bottom\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false}}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-ea661c8d\"><img class=\"wp-image-1225 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-aden-ardenrich-181745-581299-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"2560\" width=\"1705\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"4089a093\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":50,\"tablet\":50,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-4089a093\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"87c1944b\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-berk-ozdemir-3779816-scaled.jpg\",\"id\":1202,\"height\":2560,\"width\":1810,\"alt\":\"Traditional Japanese building\"},\"alignment\":{\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"border\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":10,\"right\":10,\"bottom\":10,\"left\":10,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true}}},\"width\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":1783,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":100},\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":100}},\"maxWidth\":{\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\"}},\"height\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":565,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":50}}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-87c1944b\"><img class=\"wp-image-1202 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/pexels-berk-ozdemir-3779816-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Traditional Japanese building\" height=\"2560\" width=\"1810\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/paragraph {\"clientId\":\"7bdadec6\",\"text\":\"Escape from the bustle and stress of everyday life, and relax in the comfort and tranquility of Tozai Hotel\'s guest rooms and gardens. Our expert chefs are ready to delight your taste buds with sashimi and sushi, made only from the choicest cuts of fish delivered daily from Tsukiji market in Tokyo.\",\"alignment\":{\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":400,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color\":\"#303030\",\"margin\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":20,\"bottom\":20}}} -->\n<p class=\"blockart-paragraph blockart-paragraph-7bdadec6\">Escape from the bustle and stress of everyday life, and relax in the comfort and tranquility of Tozai Hotel\'s guest rooms and gardens. Our expert chefs are ready to delight your taste buds with sashimi and sushi, made only from the choicest cuts of fish delivered daily from Tsukiji market in Tokyo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"8ac47df9\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-8ac47df9 is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"38080689\",\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"custom\",\"padding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"right\":36,\"bottom\":16,\"left\":36,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":500,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color1\":\"#000000\",\"color2\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor1\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor2\":\"#000000\",\"background1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"hoverBackground1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#0b70f4\"},\"hoverBackground2\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"type\":\"solid\",\"color\":\"#000000\"},\"hoverBorder1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"type\":\"solid\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"border2\":{\"border\":1,\"color\":\"#ffffff\",\"type\":\"solid\",\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true}}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-button blockart-button-38080689 \"><a class=\"blockart-button-link is-custom is-style-filled\">Read More</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/button-inner -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button-inner -->\n<div class=\"blockart-button blockart-button-undefined \"><a class=\"blockart-button-link is-large is-style-filled\"></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/button-inner --></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/button --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"ac4c9ec1\",\"hasModal\":true,\"columns\":1} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-ac4c9ec1\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"652e9fbe\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-652e9fbe\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"010ea8ba\"} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-010ea8ba\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:nextend/smartslider3 {\"slider\":\"2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-nextend-smartslider3\">[smartslider3 slider=\"2\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:nextend/smartslider3 -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '7-autosave-v1', '', '', '2024-05-14 14:51:25', '2024-05-14 19:51:25', '', 7, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/?p=1463', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1465, 1, '2024-05-14 15:01:20', '2024-05-14 20:01:20', '<!-- wp:yoast-seo/breadcrumbs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"7c70e247\",\"columns\":1,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"bottom\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50,\"right\":10,\"left\":10},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-7c70e247\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"6aa6581a\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100},\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0},\"desktop\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-6aa6581a\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"a1551e16\",\"markup\":\"h1\",\"text\":\"Guest Rooms\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"center\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":700,\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":39,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-a1551e16\">Guest Rooms</h1>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"d7999ebc\",\"columns\":1,\"childRow\":true} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-d7999ebc\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"37249e28\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-37249e28\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Indulge in the epitome of luxury and tranquility with our exquisite hotel rooms featuring breathtaking views that redefine the art of hospitality. Nestled in the heart of our city, our carefully curated selection of rooms provides an immersive experience that transcends the ordinary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"e1e59904\",\"columns\":2,\"childRow\":true,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"left\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"right\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":20},\"mobile\":{\"right\":10,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":10},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-e1e59904\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"a719c9f0\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-a719c9f0\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"3bcea4c6\",\"text\":\"Amenities\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-3bcea4c6\">Amenities</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unwind in our state-of-the-art fitness center, offering a range of equipment for those seeking an invigorating workout. Culinary enthusiasts will delight in our diverse dining options, each venue a culinary masterpiece that caters to the most discerning palates. Whether you crave a leisurely swim in our expansive pool, desire a moment of serenity in our lush gardens, or simply wish to stay connected with our high-speed Wi-Fi, our amenities are designed to fulfill every desire. At our hotel, every detail, from the sumptuous bedding to the cutting-edge technology, has been thoughtfully curated to ensure a seamless blend of opulence and practicality. Experience a world where every amenity is a testament to our commitment to providing an exceptional and unforgettable stay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"c6042941\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-c6042941 is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"0e234c7d\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/reservations/\"},\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"custom\",\"padding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"right\":36,\"bottom\":16,\"left\":36,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":500,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color1\":\"#000000\",\"color2\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor1\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor2\":\"#000000\",\"background1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"hoverBackground1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#0b70f4\"},\"hoverBackground2\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,