(1470, 1, '2024-05-14 15:12:13', '2024-05-14 20:12:13', '<!-- wp:yoast-seo/breadcrumbs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"8110cacd\",\"columns\":1,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"bottom\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50,\"right\":10,\"left\":10},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"bottom\":50},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-8110cacd\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"1253c03e\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100},\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true},\"mobile\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0},\"desktop\":{\"top\":0,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-1253c03e\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"b13b0be2\",\"markup\":\"h1\",\"text\":\"Dining\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"center\"},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":700,\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":39,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-b13b0be2\">Dining</h1>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"63c583e0\",\"columns\":1,\"childRow\":true} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-63c583e0\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"1fc4b941\",\"colWidth\":{\"desktop\":100,\"tablet\":100,\"mobile\":100}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-1fc4b941\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese cuisine is not only a feast for the taste buds, but for the eyes. Presentation is an important part of a chef\'s skills. If you enjoy fish, you\'ll love the restaurant at Tozai Hotel, where our master chefs will select the choicest cuts of the day\'s fresh catch to serve you mouth-watering&nbsp;<em>sashimi</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>sushi</em>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"015f80e9\",\"columns\":2,\"childRow\":true,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"left\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"right\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":20},\"mobile\":{\"right\":10,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":10},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-015f80e9\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"f45bac04\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-f45bac04\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"56ccf84b\",\"text\":\"Blend of artistry and tradition\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-56ccf84b\">Blend of artistry and tradition</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese cuisine is a harmonious blend of artistry, tradition, and a profound respect for nature\'s bounty. At its core, it reflects the Japanese philosophy of incorporating seasonal, fresh ingredients into dishes that are not only visually appealing but also deliver a nuanced explosion of flavors. Sushi, perhaps the most internationally renowned facet of Japanese cuisine, showcases the meticulous craftsmanship involved in combining vinegared rice with a variety of ingredients, such as fresh seafood and vegetables, resulting in a culinary masterpiece that delights the senses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"6ae22b63\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-6ae22b63 is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"124b06be\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"googl.com\"},\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"custom\",\"padding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"right\":36,\"bottom\":16,\"left\":36,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":500,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color1\":\"#000000\",\"color2\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor1\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor2\":\"#000000\",\"background1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"hoverBackground1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#0b70f4\"},\"hoverBackground2\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"type\":\"solid\",\"color\":\"#000000\"},\"hoverBorder1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"type\":\"solid\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"border2\":{\"border\":1,\"color\":\"#ffffff\",\"type\":\"solid\",\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"bottom\":5,\"left\":5,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true}},\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":2,\"right\":2,\"bottom\":2,\"left\":2,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":true}}}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-button blockart-button-124b06be \"><a class=\"blockart-button-link is-custom is-style-filled\" href=\"googl.com\">Read More</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/button-inner --></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"133px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:133px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"1da59a8e\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/neon-in-a-japanese-restaurant-18176489-1024x683.jpg\",\"id\":1277,\"height\":683,\"width\":1024,\"alt\":\"Neon in a Japanese Restaurant\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-1da59a8e\"><img class=\"wp-image-1277 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/neon-in-a-japanese-restaurant-18176489-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Neon in a Japanese Restaurant\" height=\"683\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"d00acf95\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"mobile\":{\"top\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":20,\"left\":0},\"tablet\":{\"top\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-d00acf95\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/image {\"clientId\":\"0860953a\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/woman-eating-sushi-in-a-restaurant-15433927-683x1024.jpg\",\"id\":1276,\"height\":1024,\"width\":683,\"alt\":\"Woman Eating Sushi in a Restaurant\"}} -->\n<figure class=\"blockart-image blockart-image-0860953a\"><img class=\"wp-image-1276 hover-effect-static filter-none mask mask-none\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/woman-eating-sushi-in-a-restaurant-15433927-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Woman Eating Sushi in a Restaurant\" height=\"1024\" width=\"683\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"949e9f5f\"} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-949e9f5f\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"d8d8ede0\",\"text\":\"Saké—the Perfect Accompaniment\",\"alignment\":{\"desktop\":\"left\"},\"size\":\"small\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-d8d8ede0 is-small\">Saké—the Perfect Accompaniment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese rice wine, saké, makes the perfect accompaniment to your meal. Although saké can be drunk hot, connoisseurs prefer to drink it cold or on the rocks. Drinking saké cold allows you to appreciate the subtle differences in taste that come from the rice variety and water used in the fermentation process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->', 'Dining', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'clos