sine is not only a feast for the taste buds, but for the eyes. Presentation is an important part of a chef\'s skills. If you enjoy fish, you\'ll love the restaurant at Tozai Hotel, where our master chefs will select the choicest cuts of the day\'s fresh catch to serve you mouth-watering&nbsp;<em>sashimi</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>sushi</em>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/column --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/section {\"clientId\":\"49e34991\",\"columns\":2,\"childRow\":true,\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":100,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"top\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"right\":0,\"left\":0,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"right\":20,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":20},\"mobile\":{\"right\":10,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false,\"left\":10},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-section blockart-section-49e34991\"><div class=\"blockart-container\"><div class=\"blockart-section-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/column {\"clientId\":\"580f7ef4\",\"blockMargin\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"mobile\":{\"bottom\":50,\"unit\":\"px\",\"lock\":false},\"dimension\":1},\"blockPadding\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"dimension\":1}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-column blockart-column-580f7ef4\"><div class=\"blockart-column-inner\"><!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"e0983201\",\"text\":\"Blend of artistry and tradition\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Poppins\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-e0983201\">Blend of artistry and tradition</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Japanese cuisine is a harmonious blend of artistry, tradition, and a profound respect for nature\'s bounty. At its core, it reflects the Japanese philosophy of incorporating seasonal, fresh ingredients into dishes that are not only visually appealing but also deliver a nuanced explosion of flavors. Sushi, perhaps the most internationally renowned facet of Japanese cuisine, showcases the meticulous craftsmanship involved in combining vinegared rice with a variety of ingredients, such as fresh seafood and vegetables, resulting in a culinary masterpiece that delights the senses. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Enim nulla aliquet porttitor lacus luctus. Lacus sed turpis tincidunt id aliquet. Quisque sagittis purus sit amet volutpat.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"4e6a1dad\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-4e6a1dad is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"09bb2e17\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"google.com\"},\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"custom\",\"padding\":{\"dimension\":1,\"desktop\":{\"lock\":false,\"top\":16,\"right\":36,\"bottom\":16,\"left\":36,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":500,\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"value\":16,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"},\"color1\":\"#000000\",\"color2\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor1\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverColor2\":\"#000000\",\"background1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\"},\"hoverBackground1\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#0b70f4\"},\"hoverBackground2\":{\"background\":1,\"type\":\"color\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border1\":{\"border\":1,\"radius\":{\"desktop\":{\"lock\":true,\"top\":5,\"right\":5,\"b