bitlampsites.com/iwp/tozai-hotel/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/a-tree-with-yellow-leaves-and-a-waterfall-in-the-background-19833834-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"A tree with yellow leaves and a waterfall in the background\" height=\"1024\" width=\"683\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/image -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/spacing {\"clientId\":\"91f91466\"} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-spacing blockart-spacing-91f91466\"><div class=\"blockart-spacing-inner\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/spacing -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/heading {\"clientId\":\"2f459665\",\"text\":\"Why Cherry Blossom Is So Special\",\"typography\":{\"typography\":1,\"weight\":\"600\",\"size\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":30,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"lineHeight\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":28,\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"family\":\"Poppins\"}} -->\n<h2 class=\"blockart-heading blockart-heading-2f459665\">Why Cherry Blossom Is So Special</h2>\n<!-- /wp:blockart/heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cherry blossoms hold a unique and revered place in various cultures, with particular significance in Japan. The blooming of cherry blossoms, known as \"sakura\" in Japanese, is an annual spectacle that marks the arrival of spring. What makes cherry blossoms so special is not only their ephemeral beauty but also the cultural and symbolic meanings associated with them. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Enim nulla aliquet porttitor lacus luctus. Lacus sed turpis tincidunt id aliquet. Quisque sagittis purus sit amet volutpat.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:blockart/button {\"clientId\":\"2273ec0a\",\"justification\":{\"desktop\":\"left\",\"tablet\":\"left\"},\"orientation\":{\"desktop\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"blockart-buttons blockart-buttons-2273ec0a is-wrap is-horizontal justify-left justify-left-md\"><!-- wp:blockart/button-inner {\"clientId\":\"148b346f\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"google.com\",\"newTab\":true},\"text\":\"Read More\",\"size\":\"cus