(34, 1, '2024-05-14 14:30:34', '2024-05-14 14:30:34', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>Themes</h1>		\n		<p>The WordPress theme directory is used by millions of WordPress users all over the world. Themes in the directory are available for download from WordPress.org, and WordPress users can also install them directly from their administration screens. When choosing themes it is best practice to select developers and themes that are updated frequently and has high ratings by users. You can customize themes and create child themes for further customizations.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/themes/\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n			<h2>Popular Themes</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container{position:static}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container .swiper-slide figure,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper .swiper-slide figure{line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-slide{text-align:center}.elementor-image-carousel-wrapper:not(.swiper-container-initialized):not(.swiper-initialized) .swiper-slide{max-width:calc(100% / var(--e-image-carousel-slides-to-show, 3))}</style>		\n								<figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ocean.webp\" alt=\"ocean\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Generatepress.webp\" alt=\"Generate Pree wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/astra.webp\" alt=\"Atra wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Royalelementorkit.webp\" alt=\"Royal elementor kit wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/elementor.webp\" alt=\"Hello Elementor wordpress theme\" /></figure>', 'Themes', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'workshop', '', '', '2024-05-14 18:15:24', '2024-05-14 18:15:24', '', 0, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/workshop/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
