(149, 1, '2024-05-14 16:24:55', '2024-05-14 16:24:55', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>The open source publishing platform of choice for millions of websites worldwide—from creators and small businesses to enterprises.</h1>		\n		<p>Teach you the basics of WordPress</p>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n									How to Get Started\n					</a>\n			Word\npress		\n			<h2>WordPress.Com vs WordPress.Org?</h2>		\n		<p>The main difference between the two is that WordPress.org does not include hosting and it is mostly used as a reference that houses information, downloads, resources, and communities to get involved. WordPress.com includes hosting and domains.</p><p><b>What does WordPress.com offer that WordPress.org does not?</b></p><p>WordPress.com takes care of most aspects when creating a website. Compared to WordPress.org, it offers hosting by WordPress and regular backups. It also requires no coding knowledge, so the learning curve for beginners will easier. It is also extremely safe security wise because it is constantly monitored and updated. </p><p><b>What does WordPress.org offer that WordPress.com does not?</b></p><p>WordPress.org is self-hosting so this could offer more freedom when creating a website. Compared to WordPress.com that offers limited SEO, there is no limitations and so this could help create better SEO. There is also more advances customization.  </p>		\n			<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n			learn more		\n		<p>Learn how to get started with WordPress</p>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n									Get Started\n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-content{width:100%}@media (min-width:768px){.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper,.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{display:flex}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:end;flex-direction:row-reverse}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:start;flex-direction:row}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-top .elementor-image-box-img{margin:auto}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-top .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-start}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-middle .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-bottom .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-end}}@media (max-width:767px){.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important;margin-bottom:15px}}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-title a{color:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-description{margin:0}</style><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/themes-qo5mt51iew3q88ipsbi5tx4j06clcibfrg37a41zis.jpg\" title=\"themes\" alt=\"themes\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h3>Themes</h3><p>Find the perfect theme for your WordPress website. Choose from thousands of stunning designs with a wide variety of features and customization options.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://library.elementor.com/ceramic-workshops-flexbox/workshops/#Workshop_Learn_The_Basics\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n			<figure><img width=\"350\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/pluginicon.png\" alt=\"plugin icon\" /></figure><h3>Plugins</h3><p>Choose from thousands of free plugins to build, customize, and enhance your WordPress website.\n</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://library.elementor.com/ceramic-workshops-flexbox/workshops/#Workshop_Master_The_Basics\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n			<figure><img width=\"768\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/maintenance-e1715703145624-768x768.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Maintenance</h3><p>Learn how to keep your site optimized, secured, and running well. </p>		\n			<a href=\"https://library.elementor.com/ceramic-workshops-flexbox/workshops/#Workshop_Be_Ceramic_Superhero\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n			<h2>Want to learn more about WordPress?</h2>		\n		<p>Build and grow your website with the best way to WordPress. Lightning-fast hosting, intuitive, flexible editing, and everything you need to grow your site and audience, baked right in.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://wordpress.com/\">\n									Learn More!\n					</a>\n			wordpress		\n		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '66-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-14 16:24:55', '2024-05-14 16:24:55', '', 66, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/?p=149', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
