abay-265667-300x194.jpg 300w, https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/pexels-pixabay-265667-768x496.jpg 768w, https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/pexels-pixabay-265667-1536x992.jpg 1536w, https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/pexels-pixabay-265667-2048x1322.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h2>Type of Plugins</h2>		\n			<h4><li>Forms\n<li>eCommerce\n<li>Builders\n<li>Blocks\n<li>SEO\n<li>Security\n<li>Analytics\n<li>Cookies\n<li>Backups/Migrations</h4>', 'Plugins', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'elementor-260', '', '', '2024-05-14 18:58:09', '2024-05-14 18:58:09', '', 0, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/?page_id=260', 0, 'page', '', 0),
