(302, 1, '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>Maintenance</h1>		\n		<p>The WordPress theme directory is used by millions of WordPress users all over the world. Themes in the directory are available for download from WordPress.org, and WordPress users can also install them directly from their administration screens. When choosing themes it is best practice to select developers and themes that are updated frequently and has high ratings by users. You can customize themes and create child themes for further customizations.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/themes/\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n			<h2>Popular Themes</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container{position:static}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container .swiper-slide figure,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper .swiper-slide figure{line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-slide{text-align:center}.elementor-image-carousel-wrapper:not(.swiper-container-initialized):not(.swiper-initialized) .swiper-slide{max-width:calc(100% / var(--e-image-carousel-slides-to-show, 3))}</style>		\n								<figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ocean.webp\" alt=\"ocean\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Generatepress.webp\" alt=\"Generate Pree wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/astra.webp\" alt=\"Atra wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Royalelementorkit.webp\" alt=\"Royal elementor kit wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/elementor.webp\" alt=\"Hello Elementor wordpress theme\" /></figure>', 'Maintenance', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '', 14, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/?p=302', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(303, 1, '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>Maintenance</h1>		\n		<p>The WordPress theme directory is used by millions of WordPress users all over the world. Themes in the directory are available for download from WordPress.org, and WordPress users can also install them directly from their administration screens. When choosing themes it is best practice to select developers and themes that are updated frequently and has high ratings by users. You can customize themes and create child themes for further customizations.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/themes/\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n			<h2>Popular Themes</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container{position:static}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container .swiper-slide figure,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper .swiper-slide figure{line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-slide{text-align:center}.elementor-image-carousel-wrapper:not(.swiper-container-initialized):not(.swiper-initialized) .swiper-slide{max-width:calc(100% / var(--e-image-carousel-slides-to-show, 3))}</style>		\n								<figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ocean.webp\" alt=\"ocean\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Generatepress.webp\" alt=\"Generate Pree wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/astra.webp\" alt=\"Atra wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Royalelementorkit.webp\" alt=\"Royal elementor kit wordpress theme\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/elementor.webp\" alt=\"Hello Elementor wordpress theme\" /></figure>', 'Maintenance', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '2024-05-14 19:20:55', '', 14, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/?p=303', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(304, 1, '2024-05-14 19:20:56', '2024-05-14 19:20:56', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 08-05-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>How to Maintain</h1>		\n		<p>Learn how to keep your site optimized, secured, and running well with some steps.</p>		\n			<h2>Back Ups</h2>		\n		<p>Make sure to back up your site regularly on a schedule. This helps in case your website is hacked or there is data loss. Plugins can help with back ups. </p>		\n			<h2>Update themes and plugins</h2>		\n		<p>Make sure to update your themes and plugins to ensure there isn\'t any vulnerabilities in your site.</p>		\n			<h2>Delete inactive themes and plugins</h2>		\n		<p>Many users download lots of themes and plugins but don\'t end up using them frequently. Inactive themes and plugins that don\'t get updated regularly can expose your website to vulnerabilities and hackers. It is best practice to delete inactive themes and plugins to remove these vulnerabilities. </p>', 'Maintenance', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-14 19:20:56', '2024-05-14 19:20:56', '', 14, 'https://kbotabara.bitlampsites.com/iwp/final/?p=304', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
